      <activity id="de6d0ff5-6bb1-5b2b-8794-731dc8e14851" activityNameId="dd702d05-7bfc-51a4-a54a-6d1ed4fa9b7d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sink, chromium steel, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sink, chromium steel, at plant
na;
UUID: 120aed0d-71ad-3e46-bf08-9a5cc262e10f
This data set includes the materials and resources needed for producing one chromium steel sink. The sink contains two basins of different size and a drainboard. The sink has the dimensions 965 x 510 x 600 mm and a weight of 8.7 kg. The data base on information from Franke GmbH. Chromium steel with a recycling content of 80 % is used. The valves are made of PET, PP and HDPE. Transport to the construction site and mounting are not included.; Geography: Data valid for Switzerland
Location:  Data valid for Switzerland
Technology: Average processes for producing chromium steel products.
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_120aed0d-71ad-3e46-bf08-9a5cc262e10f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
